WEBVTT

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:03.930
We're not playing a game.

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:16.580
I guess we have to go back.

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:18.640
Back where we were yesterday?

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:24.720
Sharla!

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.240
It's okay.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:40.840
There may be edible fruits in other places.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:44.930
We're also out of water.

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:48.210
We've already searched the whole beach.

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:52.920
Today let's proceed further into the forest
as we search for food and water.

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:54.960
Okay!

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.450
Good luck.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:00.080
I'm counting on you.

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:01.230
You're goin' too!

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:02.500
What?

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:06.480
Luna and Howard will search for water with me.

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:09.760
With you again?

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:12.380
Take Bell with you this time!

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:15.230
Today, Bell will try to start a fire here with Sharla.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:16.730
Fire?

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:17.480
Yes.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:22.230
We don't know when another
strange monster will show up.

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:26.070
Bell, you have experience on Pluto?

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:29.140
I've never actually started a fire...

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:31.830
...but I have heard how it's done.

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:32.990
Please give it a try.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:38.050
Which means the rest of us're searchin' for food, right?

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:39.850
Alright!

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:42.290
Kaoru, you go with them as well.

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:46.660
That's okay! With Shingo's brain 'n mine, we've got plenty!

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:49.240
I'll go catch fish.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.870
Independent action is forbidden, Kaoru.

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:53.160
Please stay with them.

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:55.360
Trying to slack off, were you?

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:56.950
Nice try.

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:02.200
Everyone make certain to come back before sunset.

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:06.590
Then I'll take care of this.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.260
It's our precious tool.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:13.470
We'd be in trouble if it was lost.

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:15.230
What's up with that?

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:16.540
Acting so important.

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:20.010
Now then, let's divide the food.

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:22.320
We're fine. Take it.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:25.560
Oh, really? Then I'll take yours.

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:29.880
I'm gonna eat it!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.100
Do we really need this branch?

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:46.680
We could get the fruit up in the trees with one swing.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:49.940
...but first we have to find the fruit itself.

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:52.680
It's certainly seems just to be dead weight.

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:54.380
Wanna throw it away?

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:00.630
Where do our brains come into this?

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:03.590
Where'd Kaoru get to?

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:06.830
Maybe he went fishing alone.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.630
That Kaoru's definitely slacking off right now.

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:27.480
Aren't you the one who wanted to slack off?

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:29.220
Don't be silly!

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:32.180
Kaoru's always by himself.

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:35.690
He's always been that way.

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:42.720
What's that?

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:44.280
Some creature?

00:05:56.630 --> 00:05:57.530
It's here!

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:05.350
What's up with it scaring us like that?

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.610
Luna, follow it! It's food!

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.340
Hey! Wait for me!

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:33.330
It's no use. None of them are hard enough.

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:45.120
We can't help it. Let's just take two or three
of the hardest stones from among these.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:55.560
Hey! Which way did you go?

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:01.640
It got away.

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:03.640
We can't help it.

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:08.610
Hey! I'm carrying our valuable luggage!

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:11.290
Is it okay to leave me behind like this?

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:12.980
Hurry up!

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:20.540
It's here! This way!

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:24.030
You're my dinner tonight!

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:31.560
It'f vhat way.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:39.250
Over there!

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.140
Howard, follow it!

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:50.140
It's impossible. Let's give up.

00:07:55.060 --> 00:07:56.910
What's this?

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:05.290
Are these...

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:07.750
They're animal bones.

00:08:40.530 --> 00:08:41.910
Don't turn your eyes away from him.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:43.690
Back away slowly.

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:49.090
If we get back to the thicket, we might be okay.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:54.160
Idiot!

00:08:58.790 --> 00:08:59.730
Howard!

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:04.150
Luna! Run for it!

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:16.660
This way!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:45.440
Kaoru...

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.610
It's food!

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.580
There's nothing left up this way.

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:58.130
You're kiddin', right? You're holdin' so many!

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:03.590
If you want to go, go ahead.

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:07.230
There's really nothing left?

00:10:41.350 --> 00:10:44.110
Shingo and them already gathered this many?

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:46.340
We'd better give our best too!

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:52.960
What will you do with that?

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:55.940
Can you rip the bark into small pieces?

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:09.760
When I strike these rocks together, sparks should fly off.

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:11.200
Really?

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:11.930
Yeah.

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:15.210
When it does, can you blow quickly?

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:16.790
On you?

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:19.680
Of course not.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:20.860
On the sparks.

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:23.110
S-- sorry!

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:41.970
Are you okay?

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:45.420
These stones were too brittle after all.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.570
You should stop. It's dangerous!

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:06.610
Now!

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:12.380
Sorry...

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:36.160
Just like Kaoru said, there wasn't even one fruit.

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:37.130
Oh no...

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:40.830
Oh, my eyes're foggin' up.

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:43.340
Let's go back and try fishing.

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:45.270
We don't need fish.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:48.570
I can't eat anythin' but fruit anyway.

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:49.710
It'd be pointless.

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:51.250
That's not true.

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:55.230
If you caught fish, Chako, then everyone would eat fish.

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:57.400
Then all the fruit would be left over.

00:12:57.780 --> 00:13:00.040
And then you could eat lots of fruit, couldn't you?

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:03.310
Hmm? Am I right?

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:06.720
I'm too hungry to understand.

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:07.940
What?

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:16.020
Are you really that hungry?

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:19.410
Wrong. It's all pressed in here.

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:27.940
This couldn't be...

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:30.040
...the same as the ones on the beach yesterday.

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:32.590
This is bad... very bad!

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:35.440
Let's go back after all!

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:38.240
Yeah...

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:41.330
Let's get back quickly, quickly...

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:45.440
I'm so hungry.

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:48.550
This is bad... we've lost our bearings.

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:52.080
I don't have the slightest idea
which way we should proceed.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:57.910
Are we going to climb this?

00:13:58.240 --> 00:14:00.570
Do you want to go back through the forest with the lizard?

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.040
I know.

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:12.790
It seems like I won't have to
listen to your grumbling any more.

00:14:15.550 --> 00:14:16.900
It's a lake!

00:14:18.610 --> 00:14:22.380
We did it! I had a feeling there'd be one this way!

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:25.530
Let's hurry!

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:36.870
Are you okay? You're sweating an awful lot.

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:49.280
Let me see!

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:55.240
You should stop already.

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.890
Let's just give up. You've done enough.

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.530
The way with the stones could still work.

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:04.580
I'll look for some hard-looking ones.

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.680
Until then, Bell, you take a break.

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:46.990
Delicious!

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:48.660
I've come back to life!

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:51.120
I guess our water problems are solved.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:53.630
This is plenty for our day-to-day needs.

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:08.590
Hey, let's eat.

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:09.780
Sounds good.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.250
I'll let you eat after me.

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:15.720
After all, the one who carried this around was me.

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:17.560
Do as you like.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:19.530
But divide it equally in three.

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:22.840
Let me eat just a little bit more than you.

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:24.310
It was heavy!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.050
Very well.

00:16:28.260 --> 00:16:30.120
Down the hatch!

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:43.360
Run for it!

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:51.460
Hand it over!

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:01.620
What are you doing with my lunch?

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.490
You're going to be <i>his</i> lunch!

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:05.220
Everyone! That way!

00:17:06.180 --> 00:17:06.870
Okay!

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:17.860
Wait for me!

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:40.560
Why don't you try coming up this far?

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:46.340
Your hand won't reach my foot.

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:49.430
Stop playing around and think of a way to drive him off.

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:09.040
Howard!

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:42.570
What?

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.510
Another weird thing showed up!

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:07.920
What's it doing?

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:51.180
Damn it!

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:53.760
Stay away!

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:55.990
I'll tell my Papa on you!

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:08.840
Papa!

00:20:15.640 --> 00:20:17.100
I'm saved...

00:20:24.140 --> 00:20:25.810
What was that?

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:27.570
I don't know.

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:32.110
It seems like it was scared off Howard's scream.

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:35.240
What do you mean by that?

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:41.290
Stop that! You'll hurt your hands even more!

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:44.390
Starting a fire was our responsibility.

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:48.380
Everyone else might be in more danger.

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:50.910
I'll explain to everyone!

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:53.630
How hard you tried here.

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:56.110
So stop already.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:57.960
You've done enough.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:00.290
If you show them these...

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:02.430
...everyone will understand.

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:05.030
Nobody will blame you.

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:09.640
I'm not playing a game where it matters how hard I tried.

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:13.980
We need fire no matter what if we're all going to live.

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:17.050
If we don't have fire during the night...

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:19.380
...we might be attacked by wild animals.

00:21:20.560 --> 00:21:25.000
If that happens, it won't be a matter of how hard I tried.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.890
Let's hurry up and go home.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.330
If we know the way home.

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:37.000
Do you remember how we got here?

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:39.340
Of course I don't remember.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:42.740
The lizard is still out there, and the forest is a labyrinth.

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:45.850
It's too dangerous to guess the way back.

00:21:46.680 --> 00:21:47.460
Hey...

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:50.260
Well, wait-- there's a way to do it.

00:21:50.970 --> 00:21:53.410
Once we climb that mountain, we can go home.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:56.760
It's the only way!

00:21:58.530 --> 00:22:00.810
If we try that, the sun will set on us!

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:03.850
You're the one who said to be back before sunset.

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:06.480
But it doesn't seem like there's any other way.

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:10.020
From there, we should be able to
see the beach where the shuttle is.

00:22:10.710 --> 00:22:13.830
On top of that, we can see where this lake lies in relation.

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:17.950
And we can see what the terrain here is like.

00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:22.170
Everyone else will worry if we're gone for a night.

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:25.940
That may be true, but we can't help it.

00:22:26.410 --> 00:22:27.960
Hey, are you serious?

00:22:28.710 --> 00:22:30.400
Let me say just one thing:

00:22:30.960 --> 00:22:38.130
Even if only one of us three were left,
we definitely have to return to our friends.

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:41.480
And guide everyone here.

00:22:45.290 --> 00:22:46.530
Hey, wait up!

00:22:46.940 --> 00:22:49.360
I get it! I'll come with you!

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:51.460
Wait for me!

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:05.390
Everyone's working frantically so we can all live.

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:09.460
I'm even challengin' Shingo at fishin'!

00:23:09.910 --> 00:23:11.440
Kaoru fishing with a spear...

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:13.340
Bell and Sharla trying to start a fire...

00:23:13.840 --> 00:23:19.280
And we're climbing to the peak of the highest mountain to find the way home from the lake.

00:23:20.260 --> 00:23:24.030
But what we discovered there was an astonishing truth!

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:28.410
Next time: We've only just started walking.
